      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "ok so for some reason its no longer doing that, and i'm pretty sure the only thing i changed was the radius of the first few bones, as well as lowered the floor collider a few centimeters, however raising it back up and making the radius larger again didnt reproduce it. I'll have to do some additional testing tomorrow",
